  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "New LensReceiver.CapturePhotoAsync takes a photo from the PC: it grabs the current video frame, saves it as a PNG in SnapshotFolder, returns the file's path and raises SnapshotSaved, the same as the shutter on the phone. From 1.3.0: LensPairingView shows no caption by default (set Label to add one), and the receiver ignores an offer that a newer one replaces mid-negotiation. From 1.2.0: the pairing token persists in TokenFile, so a phone reconnects by itself, and RepairAsync issues a new one; DisconnectPhoneAsync puts the receiver on hold (IsOnHold) and ConnectPhone brings the phone back without a QR scan; PhoneMode.Document saves shots to DocumentFolder and raises DocumentSaved.",
